          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_03b",
      "hash64": "DE0550390646C591",
      "text": "嘿嘿……\\n克拉韋爾校長出的課題很難吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "87159A642D54537C",
      "text": "很多學生都會選擇\\n以道館挑戰作為尋寶的方法。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "87159B642D54552F",
      "text": "雖然會很辛苦，\\n但挑戰起來很有成就感嘛～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "87159C642D5456E2",
      "text": "身為班導師，我在這裡等著\\n就是想要幫大家加油打氣。[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "87159D642D545895",
      "text": "請用在尋寶上吧～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "champ_0115_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "87159E642D545A48",
      "text": "要是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能順便努力去填寶可夢圖鑑，\\n我這個開發者是會很高興的～[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
